{"sha": "a55b647ffb0340f9eb0df6e79615cac906744bd4bf53650876ea33c6039030a9", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:circuits-and-power} 章 --- 电路与功率}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:1}", "$q = It = 2.0 \\times 90 \\times 60 = \\qty{1.1e4}{C}$。元电荷", "个数为 $q/e = 1.08\\times10^{4}/1.6\\times10^{-19} \\approx \\num{6.8e22}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:2}", "$I = U/R = 12/220 = \\qty{0.055}{A} = \\qty{55}{mA}$;", "$R = U/I = 230/0.50 = \\qty{460}{\\ohm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:3}", "串联：$120 + 60 = \\qty{180}{\\ohm}$。并联：$\\frac{120 \\times 60}{180}", "= \\qty{40}{\\ohm}$ --- 比两者都小：电压相同，但电流多了一条", "通路，因而总电流更大，电阻更小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:4}", "$P = UI = 230 \\times 8.7 = \\qty{2.0}{kW}$。当 $t = \\qty{240}{s}$ 时：", "$E = Pt = 2000 \\times 240 = \\qty{4.8e5}{J} = 4.8\\times10^{5}/3.6", "\\times10^{6} \\approx \\qty{0.13}{kW.h}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:5}", "$E = 60 \\times 5.0 = \\qty{300}{W.h} = \\qty{0.30}{kW.h} = 0.30 \\times", "3.6\\times10^{6} = \\qty{1.1e6}{J}$。费用：$0.30 \\times 0.25 = 0.075$", "欧元/天。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:6}", "\\emph{1.} $R = U^2/P = 230^2/1200 = \\qty{44}{\\ohm}$;", "$I = P/U = 1200/230 = \\qty{5.2}{A}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $P' = U'^2/R = 115^2/44.1 = \\qty{300}{W}$：功率变为原来的", "四分之一而非一半，因为减半 $U$ 时 $I$ 也随之减半，而 $P = UI \\propto U^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:7}", "$R_{\\text{串}} = \\qty{60}{\\ohm}$，故 $I = 12/60 = \\qty{0.20}{A}$。", "$U_1 = R_1 I = \\qty{8.0}{V}$，$U_2 = \\qty{4.0}{V}$（总和 \\qty{12}{V}）；", "$P_1 = U_1 I = \\qty{1.6}{W}$，$P_2 = \\qty{0.8}{W}$：总功率 \\qty{2.4}{W}", "$= UI = 12 \\times 0.20$，与此相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:8}", "$I_1 = 12/60 = \\qty{0.20}{A}$，$I_2 = 12/30 = \\qty{0.40}{A}$，总电流", "$I = \\qty{0.60}{A}$。等效电阻：$R = U/I = 12/0.60 = \\qty{20}{\\ohm}$，", "且确实 $\\frac{60 \\times 30}{60 + 30} = \\qty{20}{\\ohm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:9}", "$\\mathcal{E} - 0.50\\,r = 5.5$ 与 $\\mathcal{E} - 2.0\\,r = 4.0$；", "两式相减，$1.5\\,r = 1.5$，故 $r = \\qty{1.0}{\\ohm}$，$\\mathcal{E} =", "\\qty{6.0}{V}$。短路时：$\\mathcal{E}/r = \\qty{6.0}{A}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:10}", "电水壶 $2200/230 = \\qty{9.6}{A}$，烤面包机 $1000/230 = \\qty{4.3}{A}$：", "合计 \\qty{13.9}{A} $< \\qty{16}{A}$，保险丝不熔断。取暖器 $1500/230 =", "\\qty{6.5}{A}$：合计 \\qty{20.4}{A} $> \\qty{16}{A}$，保险丝熔断", "（等价地，$\\qty{4.7}{kW} > 230 \\times 16 \\approx \\qty{3.7}{kW}$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:11}", "在 \\qty{200}{V} 下：$I = 10^4/200 = \\qty{50}{A}$，损耗 $RI^2 = 2.0 \\times", "50^2 = \\qty{5.0}{kW}$ --- 占输送功率的一半。在 \\qty{4.0}{kV} 下：$I =", "\\qty{2.5}{A}$，损耗 $2.0 \\times 2.5^2 = \\qty{12.5}{W}$。比值 $400 =", "20^2$：电压变为原来的二十倍，意味着电流变为原来的二十分之一，", "而损耗与 $I^2$ 成正比。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:12}", "四种连接方式：全部串联，$3 \\times 60 = \\qty{180}{\\ohm}$；全部", "并联，$60/3 = \\qty{20}{\\ohm}$；一个与两个并联的电阻串联，", "$60 + 30 = \\qty{90}{\\ohm}$；一个与两个串联的电阻并联，", "$\\frac{60 \\times 120}{180} = \\qty{40}{\\ohm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:13}", "\\emph{1.} $I = \\mathcal{E}/(R + r) = 4.5/7.5 = \\qty{0.60}{A}$;", "$U = RI = \\qty{3.6}{V}$；有用功率 $P = UI = \\qty{2.2}{W}$；损失的功率 $rI^2 =", "1.5 \\times 0.60^2 = \\qty{0.54}{W}$; $\\eta = U/\\mathcal{E} = 3.6/4.5 =", "0.80$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 由提示，$P = \\mathcal{E}^2 \\big/ \\big[(R - r)^2/R +", "4r\\big]$；括号项最小（$= 4r$）恰在 $R = r$ 时取到。", "$P_{\\max} = \\mathcal{E}^2/(4r) = 4.5^2/6.0 = \\qty{3.4}{W}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:14}", "热量：$Q = 1.0 \\times 4180 \\times (100 - 20) = \\qty{3.3e5}{J}$。", "电能：$E = Q/0.90 = \\qty{3.7e5}{J}$。时间：$t = E/P =", "3.7\\times10^{5}/2200 \\approx \\qty{170}{s}$，不到三分钟。费用：", "$3.7\\times10^{5}/3.6\\times10^{6} \\approx \\qty{0.10}{kW.h}$，约 $2.6$", "美分。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:circuits-and-power:15}", "\\emph{1.} $q = 60 \\times 3600 = \\qty{2.2e5}{C}$; $E \\approx \\mathcal{E}q", "= 12.7 \\times 2.16\\times10^{5} = \\qty{2.7e6}{J} \\approx \\qty{0.76}{kW.h}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $U = 12.7 - 0.020 \\times 150 = \\qty{9.7}{V}$；输出功率", "$UI = \\qty{1.5}{kW}$；损失的功率 $rI^2 = 0.020 \\times 150^2 = \\qty{450}{W}$。", "", "\\emph{3.} 车头灯并联在接线柱两端：启动发动机时，", "端电压由 $12.7$ 降至 $\\qty{9.7}{V}$，因此车头灯获得的", "功率减小，灯光变暗。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}